    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're interested, be sure to Wishlist the game - that helps a lot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/a77955516e636f409752bad663c853c5.avif?t=1754482358\" /></div>Infinitevania is a 2D platformer in the metroidvania style, heavily inspired by Castlevania: Symphony of the Night and featuring elements from Hollow Knight. The game focuses on combat, exploration, puzzles, upgrades, and an breathtaking story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Explore different worlds</strong></i></u> <br>Defeat the most powerful creatures in these worlds, absorb their powers, and grow stronger to destroy the core of Infinitevania and return to your own world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/23d3ab332f71fe83c19b3c3d65cd90e4.poster.avif?t=1754482358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/23d3ab332f71fe83c19b3c3d65cd90e4.webm?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/23d3ab332f71fe83c19b3c3d65cd90e4.mp4?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/c2d2d6d80936f9c306c83355ee0dac79.avif?t=1754482358\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Face challenging enemies</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop unique strategies to overcome them, adapting to each battle as you progress on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/f489e08cf6340459bf1586bd2028dda4.poster.avif?t=1754482358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/f489e08cf6340459bf1586bd2028dda4.webm?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/f489e08cf6340459bf1586bd2028dda4.mp4?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/c776734cb7d703679d02d43ff3a87088.poster.avif?t=1754482358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/c776734cb7d703679d02d43ff3a87088.webm?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/c776734cb7d703679d02d43ff3a87088.mp4?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/2130466749aaad679baa5f16859daeab.avif?t=1754482358\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Solve puzzles</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle intriguing enigmas to unlock new areas and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/9be3294700f554e45bfb90829058060b.poster.avif?t=1754482358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/9be3294700f554e45bfb90829058060b.webm?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/9be3294700f554e45bfb90829058060b.mp4?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/0622e5ab9fce6171d585b86ad4d87e22.avif?t=1754482358\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Survive deadly traps</strong></i></u> <br>Navigate treacherous environments that test your skills and reflexes at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/125a68ea3ab28bb29bb7ebd5d6408853.poster.avif?t=1754482358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/125a68ea3ab28bb29bb7ebd5d6408853.webm?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/125a68ea3ab28bb29bb7ebd5d6408853.mp4?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/fa8a089643e81bdcca46c8225291378d.avif?t=1754482358\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Collect Upgrades to Become Stronger</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your abilities and equipment throughout your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/2b31a6c7c245342ac044167ea164fd38.poster.avif?t=1754482358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/2b31a6c7c245342ac044167ea164fd38.webm?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/2b31a6c7c245342ac044167ea164fd38.mp4?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're interested, be sure to Wishlist the game - that helps a lot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/a77955516e636f409752bad663c853c5.avif?t=1754482358\" /></div>Infinitevania is a 2D platformer in the metroidvania style, heavily inspired by Castlevania: Symphony of the Night and featuring elements from Hollow Knight. The game focuses on combat, exploration, puzzles, upgrades, and an breathtaking story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Explore different worlds</strong></i></u> <br>Defeat the most powerful creatures in these worlds, absorb their powers, and grow stronger to destroy the core of Infinitevania and return to your own world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/23d3ab332f71fe83c19b3c3d65cd90e4.poster.avif?t=1754482358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/23d3ab332f71fe83c19b3c3d65cd90e4.webm?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/23d3ab332f71fe83c19b3c3d65cd90e4.mp4?t=1754482358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/c2d2d6d80936f9c306c83355ee0dac79.avif?t=1754482358\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Face challenging enemies</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop unique strategies to overcome them, adapting to each battle as you progress on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl